  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "hub-center",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# \ud83c\udf10 CV Projects Knowledge Hub & Spatial Map\n\nWelcome to the **Computer Vision & Perception Knowledge Vault**.\n\n### \ud83d\udcca Vault Architecture\n- **20 Perception & Robotics Domains** (`topics/`)\n- **98 Landmark Architecture Notes** (`architectures/`)\n- **20 Silicon Hardware Targets** (`hardware/`)\n- **18 Acceleration Runtimes** (`frameworks/`)\n- **24 Production-Grade Cookbooks** (`cookbooks/`)\n- **Shared Sensors Library** (`cookbooks/common/`)\n\n*Click any card or direct link below to navigate directly into technical playbooks and runnable recipes.*",
      "x": -270,
      "y": -170,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-mocs",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "CENTRAL VAULT INDEXES (MOCs)",
      "x": -940,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 1140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "moc-arch",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Model Architectures MOC\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[architectures/00-architectures-moc|Open Architectures Index \u2197]]**\n\n- **98 SOTA Architectures** indexed with YAML properties\n- Object Detectors, Segmenters, Transformers, SSMs & VLMs\n- Verified commercial licenses (Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD)",
      "x": -900,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "moc-hw",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \u26a1 Hardware Targets MOC\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[hardware/00-hardware-moc|Open Hardware Targets Index \u2197]]**\n\n- **20 Silicon Platforms**: NVIDIA Blackwell, Jetson Orin/Thor, AMD Versal Gen 2, ARM Cortex-R52, Loihi 2\n- Compute specs, TOPS/W, memory bandwidth, ASIL safety tiers",
      "x": -900,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "moc-fw",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Acceleration Frameworks MOC\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[frameworks/00-frameworks-moc|Open Frameworks Index \u2197]]**\n\n- **18 Runtime Frameworks**: TensorRT 10, ONNX Runtime, Vulkan SC 2.0, AMD Quark, Iceoryx2, Zenoh\n- Zero-copy IPC, execution providers, and ISO 26262 runtimes",
      "x": -900,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "moc-cookbooks",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udf73 Runnable Cookbooks MOC\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[cookbooks/00-cookbooks-moc|Open Cookbooks Catalog \u2197]]**\n\n- **24 Complete Recipes** with standalone Python/Rust code\n- Mathematical derivations, Mermaid flows, and hardware benchmarks\n- Shared sensor primitives in `cookbooks/common/`",
      "x": -900,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-perception",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "CORE 2D/3D PERCEPTION DOMAINS",
      "x": 380,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 1140,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "topic-det",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfaf 1. Object Detection\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[topics/object-detection/00-object-detection-moc|Detection Domain MOC \u2197]]**\n\n- **SOTA**: RF-DETR, RT-DETRv3, YOLOv10-26, Grounding DINO\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/object-detection/README|Detection Production Guide]]\n- **Key Metric**: 56.9 mAP @ 1.15 ms (TensorRT FP16)",
      "x": 420,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "topic-seg",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f 2. Object Segmentation\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[topics/object-segmentation/00-object-segmentation-moc|Segmentation Domain MOC \u2197]]**\n\n- **SOTA**: SAM 2.1, Depth Anything V2, Mask2Former\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/object-segmentation/README|Segmentation Production Guide]]\n- **Key Metric**: 44 FPS live video mask streaming (SAM 2)",
      "x": 420,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "topic-track",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfc3 3. Video Tracking\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[topics/video-tracking/00-video-tracking-moc|Tracking Domain MOC \u2197]]**\n\n- **SOTA**: ByteTrack, BoT-SORT, CoTracker3\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/video-tracking/README|Video Tracking Production Guide]]\n- **Key Metric**: 80.3 MOTA @ 0.35 ms association latency",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "topic-fusion",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\udd00 4. Multi-Modal Sensor Fusion\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[topics/sensor-fusion/00-sensor-fusion-moc|Sensor Fusion MOC \u2197]]**\n\n- **SOTA**: MIT BEVFusion, Sparse4D v3, UniAD\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/sensor-fusion/README|Sensor Fusion Production Guide]]\n- **Key Metric**: 72.9% NDS @ 41.0 ms Camera-LiDAR BEV",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
