    {
      "id": "card-vla",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83e\udd16 Physical AI & Embodied Robotics\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[topics/vla-and-physical-ai-robotics/00-vla-and-physical-ai-robotics-moc|Open VLA Robotics MOC \u2197]]**\n\n- **Foundations**: OpenVLA 7B, pi_0 Flow Matching, Octo, ACT C-VAE\n- **Spatial SLAM**: 3DGS Lie SLAM, MonoGS, SplaTAM\n- **Safety Invariant**: Control Barrier Functions (CBF-QP at 10 kHz)\n- **Hardware**: NVIDIA Jetson Thor & AMD Versal AI Edge Gen 2",
      "x": -230,
      "y": -520,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "3"
    },
