    {
      "id": "card-edge",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \ud83d\ude80 Real-Time Systems & Edge Deployment\n> \ud83d\udd17 **[[topics/gpu-deployment/00-gpu-deployment-moc|Open GPU Deployment MOC \u2197]]**\n\n- **DL Compilers**: TensorRT 10, ONNX Runtime IOBinding, Vulkan SC 2.0\n- **Transport**: Iceoryx2 POSIX shared memory (<1 us zero-copy IPC)\n- **Scheduling**: Rate Monotonic (RMS) & EDF hard real-time schedulers\n- **Hardware Targets**: Jetson Orin/Thor, AMD Versal, Zynq UltraScale+",
      "x": -230,
